DATA ATTRIBUTION

This project uses the MaleCNS connectome (v1.0), released by Janelia Research
Campus and Google Research under CC-BY 4.0. https://male-cns.janelia.org/

Neuron model parameters follow Shiu et al. 2024, "A Drosophila computational
brain model reveals sensorimotor processing", Nature 634:210-219.
